<feature_description encoding="literal-redacted">
# sh-to-py P4: dev-only skills

Part of the sh-to-py bash-to-Python migration (umbrella tracking issue links all parts).

**Goal**: Port the dev-only .claude/skills script surfaces: release, audit-runs, combine-issues, analyze-issues.

**Absorbs (approx lines)**: .claude/skills/release/scripts/classify-bump.sh (355 — reuse existing python/version_bump.py), release-prepare.sh (278), release-finish.sh (357), release-set-version.sh (74), promote-latest-release.sh (111); scripts/promote-release.sh (93), verify-main.sh (93), read-plugin-version.sh (28); .claude/skills/audit-runs/scripts/audit-scan-run.sh (782), audit-resolve-prs.sh (328), audit-map-runs.sh (279), audit-compute-counters.sh (160), audit-preflight.sh (146), audit-close-priors.sh (121), audit-title.sh (94), audit-title-matcher.sh (65), audit-pacific-timestamp.sh (53); .claude/skills/combine-issues/scripts/apply-combination.sh (145), fetch-combinable-issues.sh (56); .claude/skills/analyze-issues/scripts/run-analysis.sh (115), fetch-issues.sh (71).

**Notes**: dev-only surface (not shipped runtime behavior); release classification rules remain authoritative in .claude/skills/release/scripts/classify-bump.md. Harnesses test-release-prepare.sh, test-audit-runs.sh (2997) port to pytest here.

**Dependencies (wired natively via /block-issue)**: B1, B3.

**Definition of done**: importable functions; CLI verbs in python/cli.py; direct call-site cutover (no shims); pytest replaces harness coverage; absorbed bash + harnesses deleted; stale-reference sweep; make lint + py-lint + py-test green.

</feature_description>


